[{"id":"1121472517712093184","date":1556214858000,"rawContent":"I lived through a horrible #metoo experience that I would never wish on anyone else. I never should have privately shared that. My reaction to what happened there, the panic attacks, the mental abuse, the emotional abuse, all being used against me now. Hideous to have that happen","userId":2648967558,"media":null,"username":"SweetViolettes","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":35,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1121477780414267392","date":1556216113000,"rawContent":"I mean who wants to admit that they were stupid enough to confess every little private detail of their life to someone. Then had it all thrown back at them in an attempt to devalue them. I am a #metoo victim. I shared all of that. Now I've had that trust used against me.","userId":2648967558,"media":null,"username":"SweetViolettes","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":36,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1127935714799304705","date":1557755805000,"rawContent":"@SMblenga @mcmad1990 Thank you. I think she should have a good read of everything that has gone on with Roycey and steer clear. Serious #metoo situation going on. I would hate to see another victim to the growing list.","userId":2648967558,"media":null,"username":"SweetViolettes","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sum